         ORG      100

Loop,    Load     X       / Load X
         Subt     Eleven  / Compare X to 11
         SkipCond 000     / If AC<0 (X is less than 11), continue loop
         Jump     Endloop / If X is not less than 11, terminate loop

         Load     Sum
         Add      X       / Add X to Sum
         Store    Sum     / Store result in Sum

         Load     X
         Add      One     / Increment X
         Store    X

         Jump     Loop

Endloop, Load     Sum
         Output           / Print Sum
         Halt             / Terminate program

Sum,     Dec  0           / Storage for Sum (value 0 given in problem)
X,       Dec  0           / Storage for X (value 1 given in problem)
One,     Dec  1           / The constant 1
Eleven,  Dec  11          / The constant 11
